msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 23 (RCinput)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:92
#: d5026a98ef7643399b4eb3d5a6b99077
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` = 4 (Half-Duplex)"
